# Phase 0: Test Analysis and Reusability Check

> **Purpose**: Analyze test description, identify reusable components, and define investigation scope.
> This phase prevents duplicate code generation and ensures safe extension of existing classes.

## 📋 Metadata
- **ID**: `phase_0_reusability`
- **Name**: Phase 0 - Reusability Analysis
- **Phase**: 0 (First Step - MANDATORY)
- **Next Phase**: **[Phase 1 - Locator Research](mdc:Phase1_LocatorResearch.mdc)**

---

## 🎯 Phase Objectives

1. Understand complete test description before any other actions
2. Identify which components already exist (Page Objects, Business, Locators)
3. Determine which components can be reused vs need to be created new
4. Document reusability decisions with justification
5. Define investigation scope for Phase 1 (skip existing components)

