### **Functional Layer (Page Objects) Example - Split + Merge Pattern**

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG - Modifying existing method breaks tests
async fillLoginForm(username: string, password: string): Promise<void> {
    await this.usernameInput.fill(username);
    await this.passwordInput.fill(password);
    await this.rememberMeCheckbox.check(); // ❌ NEW - breaks existing tests
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Split + Merge Pattern for Functional Layer
